  <x:String x:Key="csh.menu.restock">To'ldirish va muddatlar</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="csh.menu.switchCashier">Kassirni almashtirish</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="switchCashier.title">Kassirni almashtirish</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="switchCashier.message">Keyingi kassirning login va parolini kiriting. Joriy smena yopiladi (oddiy smena yopilgandagi kabi). To'g'ri ma'lumotlar kiritilmaguncha hech narsa o'zgarmaydi.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="switchCashier.emailWatermark">Email</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="switchCashier.passwordWatermark">Parol</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="switchCashier.confirmButton">Almashtirish</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.tabReorder">Omborni to'ldirish</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.reorderSubtitle">Ushbu kassada qayd etilgan sotuvlar asosida hisoblanadi. Agar hali sotuvlar bo'lmagan bo'lsa yoki yangilanishdan beri bir-ikki kundan kam vaqt o'tgan bo'lsa, ro'yxat bo'sh bo'ladi.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.lookbackLabel">Sotuv tezligini shu davr uchun hisoblash:</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.colDailyRate">Sotuv/kun</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.colDaysLeft">Yetadi</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.reorderEmpty">Bashorat uchun hali sotuv tarixi yo'q. "Serverdan tarixni yuklash" tugmasini bosing yoki bir necha kun kuting — kassa har bir sotuvdan keyin ma'lumotlarni o'zi yig'adi.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.backfillButton">Serverdan tarixni yuklash</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.tabExpiry">Yaroqlilik muddati</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.expirySubtitle">Yaroqlilik muddati — mahsulot toifasiga qarab taxminiy baho (AI kalitisiz haqiqiy internet qidiruvi ishlamaydi, sozlamalarga qarang). Kelgan sana — mahsulot qoldig'i ushbu kassada ilk bor paydo bo'lgan kun.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.colIntakeDate">Kelgan</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.colExpiryDate">Muddati</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.expiryEmpty">Hali kelgan sanasi ma'lum mahsulotlar yo'q — bu sana mahsulot qoldig'i paydo bo'lishi bilanoq avtomatik qayd etiladi.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="posSettings.operations.loyaltyTitle">Sodiqlik dasturi</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="posSettings.operations.loyaltySubtitle">Balans ushbu kassada mahalliy saqlanadi — NurCRM'da hali mijoz ballari uchun maydon yo'q.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="posSettings.operations.loyaltyEnable">Bonuslarni yoqish</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="posSettings.operations.loyaltyEarnPercent">Chek summasidan bonus foizi</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="csh.menu.logout">Chiqish</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="csh.menu.exitApp">Ish stoliga chiqish</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="csh.menu.newBadge">Yangi</x:String>

