  <x:String x:Key="migrateOffline.title">Oflayn rejimga o'tish</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="migrateOffline.message">Oflayn rejimni faollashtirish kalitini kiriting va yangi mahalliy login/parol o'ylab toping — joriy mahsulotlar katalogi serverdan to'liq sinxronlanadi va oflayn ishlash uchun saqlanadi.</x:String>
