  <x:String x:Key="posSettings.screen.showCatalogPhotosDesc">Agar mahsulotning yuklangan rasmi bo'lmasa, faqat nomi ko'rsatiladi.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="posSettings.screen.cashbox">Kassa</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="posSettings.screen.cashboxDesc">Standart bo'yicha birinchi faol kassa olinadi. Agar u boshqa kassa bo'lsa, kerakligini shu yerdan tanlang.</x:String>
