  <x:String x:Key="posSettings.screen.langEnglish">Inglizcha</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="posSettings.screen.languagePackHint">Ingliz, turk va o'zbek tillari — pullik "Til paketi": Marketpleys → Qo'shimcha funksiyalar</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="posSettings.screen.uiScale">Masshtab</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="posSettings.screen.uiScaleDesc">Kassa ekranidagi barcha elementlarning o'lchami — 50% dan 200% gacha. Qayta ishga tushirmasdan darhol qo'llaniladi.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="posSettings.screen.tileSize">Mahsulot kartalari o'lchami</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="posSettings.screen.tileSizeDesc">Kattaroq — sensorli ekranda barmoq bilan bosish qulay, kichikroq — ekranga ko'proq mahsulot sig'adi. Yuqori panel va chekka ta'sir qilmaydi.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="posSettings.screen.layoutMode">Kassa ko'rinishi</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="posSettings.screen.layoutModeDesc">Kassa ekranining oltita ko'rinishi. Kartochkani tanlang — kassa qayta ishga tushirmasdan darhol o'zgaradi. Mahsulotlar, cheklar, to'lov va skaner barcha ko'rinishlarda bir xil ishlaydi.</x:String>
